---
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import GoogleAnalytics from "../components/GoogleAnalytics.astro";
import CookieConsent from "../components/CookieConsent.astro";

---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <GoogleAnalytics />
  <title>Our Journey | ErsSoft Limited</title>

  <meta
    name="description"
    content="Explore the ErsSoft Limited journey from its foundation in 2021 to JD Edwards consulting, in-house business solutions, data analytics and artificial intelligence."
  />

  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://www.erssoft.co.uk/our-journey/" />

  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta property="og:site_name" content="ErsSoft Limited" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="Our Journey | ErsSoft Limited" />
  <meta
    property="og:description"
    content="From our foundation to JD Edwards consulting, in-house solutions, data and artificial intelligence, explore the ErsSoft journey."
  />
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://www.erssoft.co.uk/our-journey/" />
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://www.erssoft.co.uk/assets/logo.png" />

  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="Our Journey | ErsSoft Limited" />
  <meta
    name="twitter:description"
    content="From our foundation to JD Edwards consulting, in-house solutions, data and artificial intelligence, explore the ErsSoft journey."
  />
  <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://www.erssoft.co.uk/assets/logo.png" />

  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0b1020">

  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/assets/favicon-32x32.png">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/assets/favicon-16x16.png">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/assets/apple-touch-icon.png">

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/common.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/header.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/footer.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/our-journey.css">
</head>

<body>

<Header />

<main class="journey-page">

  <section class="journey-intro">
    <span class="journey-eyebrow">ErsSoft Limited</span>

    <h1>Our Journey</h1>

    <p>
      From our foundation to JD Edwards consulting and in-house solutions,
      ErsSoft continues to develop through experience, technology and
      practical business knowledge.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="journey-timeline" aria-label="ErsSoft journey timeline">

    <div class="journey-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <article class="journey-item">
      <div class="journey-marker">
        <span class="journey-dot"></span>
        <span class="journey-year">2021</span>
      </div>

      <div class="journey-card">
        <span class="journey-label">The Beginning</span>
        <h2>ErsSoft Limited Founded</h2>

        <p>
          ErsSoft Limited was established in the United Kingdom,
          built on years of experience in ERP systems, JD Edwards
          and business processes.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="journey-item">
      <div class="journey-marker">
        <span class="journey-dot"></span>
        <span class="journey-year">2022</span>
      </div>

      <div class="journey-card">
        <span class="journey-label">A New Step</span>
        <h2>First Project</h2>

        <p>
          ErsSoft started its first project engagement with Renaissance.
          This was an important step in bringing our ERP experience
          into the new company and beginning our project journey.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="journey-item">
      <div class="journey-marker">
        <span class="journey-dot"></span>
        <span class="journey-year">2023–2024</span>
      </div>

      <div class="journey-card">
        <span class="journey-label">Time to Reflect</span>
        <h2>A Period of Transition</h2>

        <p>
          These were quieter years for ErsSoft. We used this period
          to review our direction, maintain our knowledge and think
          about how our experience could be used in future solutions.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="journey-item">
      <div class="journey-marker">
        <span class="journey-dot"></span>
        <span class="journey-year">2025</span>
      </div>

      <div class="journey-card">
        <span class="journey-label">From Experience to Development</span>
        <h2>Building Our Own Solutions</h2>

        <p>
          ErsSoft started developing in-house business solutions.
          Our aim was to turn practical experience from ERP,
          business processes and real working environments into
          useful software.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="journey-item">
      <div class="journey-marker">
        <span class="journey-dot"></span>
        <span class="journey-year">2026</span>
      </div>

      <div class="journey-card">
        <span class="journey-label">Moving Forward</span>
        <h2>JD Edwards &amp; In-House Solutions</h2>

        <p>
          ErsSoft continues to focus on JD Edwards and ERP consulting
          while developing its own business applications. Our work now
          brings together ERP experience, software development, data
          and new technologies.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="journey-item">
      <div class="journey-marker">
        <span class="journey-dot"></span>
        <span class="journey-year">CURRENT</span>
      </div>

      <div class="journey-card">
        <span class="journey-label">The Journey Continues</span>
        <h2>ERP, Data &amp; Artificial Intelligence</h2>

        <p>
          Today, our journey also includes
          data analytics and artificial intelligence, bringing together ERP
          experience, software development and new technologies to build
          practical solutions for real business needs.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>

  </section>

  <section class="journey-ending">
    <p>
      Our journey continues — combining experience, technology and
      practical business knowledge to build better solutions.
    </p>
  </section>

</main>

<Footer />
<CookieConsent />

<script is:inline src="/js/our-journey.js"></script>

</body>
</html>